    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Heeheeweega Gora ea Datani sea Abiramu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gageanu buuneeda Gora, was orjeeda Ishari, was orjeeda Gohati, was orjeeda Lawi, sea Datani ea Abiramu, was orjooga Eliyabu, ea Oni, orjeeda Beleti, was orjooga Rubeni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fiisu seaniin abeeda niing'waay geat sea fiisu hees bughalaji iyeenya ea haradam ea damanamughuush bea Israeli, ahaaghwa fuga bwatgeat, was gea siloat aba jeeda fuga girgweageeda haw, was fuga nalaat, ak ghaheawa ng'asheega Musa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata ghabwat geat nea ghaheawa ng'asheega Musa ea Haruni ak gwayeesha, “Agooga noosheagiichi aba gideaba fuga bwatgeat sean ea ghaydidi, giliwas sih aba jeenyaawa, gwanda NG'UTAMIIDA jeenyaawa; abeeda ghwasaan inyas giidiing'u geaw aba fuga bwatgeat bea NG'UTAMIIDA?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwayiiy Musa ng'asheesu, ghoabeada nea ghwabada jih ng'eanyi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'ata goobalool Gora sea fugaaschi sean bwatgeat, ak gwayeesha, “Sakteayda gayghoahiimu NG'UTAMIIDA fugaaschi geabeang'a, ak ea ng'eaha siida ghaydit, ak ea ng'eaha siida jea ghwanung' gawa headaanyi; aba gideaba, siida jea ghwaloat niny dea jea gawa heeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asina ng'asheanji; ageani haleanjeeda sigwariideawa hideeda, Gora sea fugaaschi sean bwatgeat; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayiina beasta, ak numuji ghoayiinyi hideeda badayda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA; ak abeeda siida jea ghwaloat NG'UTAMIIDA, gayghoah siida ghaydit; agooga noosheagiichi, fuga Lawi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Musa ak gwayeesha Gora, “Asi oaleaydiit, orjooga Lawi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neada iyoong'ulayi agooga ng'asheanji ea mwanang'i aba heedeang'wa, gideaba ASEETA Israeli ghwasajeagwa aba jeeda fuga bwatgeat bea Israeli, ak abeeda ghwaadeagwa headaanyi; ak goosinyi gadiyeeda aba gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghoamiinaadi aba madeeda girgweageeda ak googadiyeesi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea gideaba niyeaneey gooneekiinyi, sea orjooga giyeang'wa sean was orjooga Lawi sea ang'iing'i? Ama agooga googasayi eara ashoohoocheanduumeeda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi iisunu ang'iing'i sea fugaagu sean bwatgeat noabwachi geat nea magasa NG'UTAMIIDA; ama Haruni, niny gooniiksi aba naaha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeakta Musa buuneeda gaguursa Datani sea Abiramu, orjooga Eliyabu; ak gwayi saawa, “Aseasa majeapkaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheanji ea mwanang'i gideaba giiruunaneasa ng'eanyiida nyiit eanooga ea maleeda, ak gibwarjeasa aba dareapcheeda, ak eara aba ng'asheesu giidiing'u geaw ang'iing'i ea heeni muuchi aba heedeanya? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea miyeaneasa ng'eanyiida nyiit eanooga ea maleeda, ak ea mii gooneasa madameega jea eehearana, ea madameega sabiibu; neada gigasayi ng'uda gheanyangeaba fiisu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanyareas Musa muuchi, ak gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA, “Adumwasi haleanjeeda nyaawa bea ghadooweeda; aniini miidageandeawa saawa eara digeanagi, ak ea mii dasawan eara siyagi aba jeenyaawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Musa Gora, “Ang'iing'i ea girgweageadaang'u sean numuji apkaani hiji bea madeeda NG'UTAMIIDEAN, ang'iing'i, ea saawa, ea Haruni; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ea daba siisi geanu gidaanyi sigwariideawa hideeda, ak ghwayiin hideeda jeeda, ak gooyeadu madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, haleanjeeda sigwariideawa hideeda hita bughalaji iyeenya ea haradam ea damanamughuush; ak eara ang'iing'i ea Haruni ea daba siisi mideawa gidaanyi gwariideawa hideeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaba siisi geanu gidaanyi gwariideawa hideeda, ak ghwayiin beasta jeeda, ak ghwayiin hideeda jeeda beasta, nea ghamiinaada aba ghuuta maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa, sea Musa ea Haruni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghabwada geat Gora girgweageeda sean nea gang'ula saawa aba ghuuta maheemajeanda siroondooscheesa; ak ghwahidu giigheambiita NG'UTAMIIDA madeeda fuga sean bwatgeat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goobalool NG'UTAMIIDA Musa ea Haruni, ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asaja geat aba jeedeaba fiisu bwatgeadiin, ak abeeda ghaalamwaji dalas uhuuda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoabeada nea ghabwada jeesinga ng'eanyi, nea gwayi, “Ea ASEETA, ASEETA bea gurooruunatka gilinyoo gwandeawa saseeda, gaygwasin siyagi riing'eeda, ak gaynyareeksiina fuga sean bwatgeat?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eeshiina fuga bwatgeat, Ang'amwana heeda neekeewa giibinda Gora, ea Datani, ea Abiramu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eat Musa ak gaweesa Datani ea Abiramu; sea gweargwa Israeli ak goodeayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goobalool fuga bwatgeat, ak gwayeesha, “Geamuscheegwa ang'amwana jeedeaba maheemajeandeaba fiisu munyasiin, nea adoasachi gida wassean itaanyaawa, adealas uhuudeang'wa aba riing'eega nyaawa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghang'amwa heeda neekeewa giibinda Gora, ea Datani ea Abiramu aba meadajeega sean; ak gwarita jarooda geaba Datani ea Abiramu, ak ghamiinaada aba ghuusiga maheemajeega nyaawa, sea gadeemga nyaawa, ea orjooga nyaawa, sea diibiga nyaawa manang'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda Musa ak gwayeesha, “Aba ng'asheanji gajanala gideaba goojeaknean NG'UTAMIIDA, dasin gadiyoojusu seaniin; aba gideaba measini aba fughareedeanyu aniini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fiisu iimeewa miyeeda gealaan, ghameawda gidameewiida buuneesean, ghana ghwanyas habitkweeda uurji dea nyasa buuneesean; abeeda aniini ea meajeaknean NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iisin NG'UTAMIIDA ng'asheandeesh, ak ghwajaat ghuut ak ghwanukghuta fiisu sea haleanjeeda nyaawa, ak gaweay gheeda maloonghajeega, abeeda gajanala gideaba fiisu nifool NG'UTAMIIDA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghoahiit balooldeaba ng'asheesu seaniin, ghabwaasha ng'eanyiida was dea miinaadawa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak ghoabwara ghuut ng'eanyiida ak ghwanukghuta, sea fuga gealga nyaawa, sea buuneesean ang'waay geat sea Gora, ea haleanjeeda nyaawa sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak saawa ea fuga sean mideawa, ghwararang'aada gaweay jeeda gheeda maloonghajeega nea majeekcheewi; ak gwadukuta ng'eanyiida saawa, ak goosha ghang'amwa jeeda fuga bwatgeat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda fuga Israeli mida murdajeega nyaawa gwasalda aba shooka nyaawa; aba gideaba gwayi, “Gajiidu gwayamu geaw ng'eanyiida ak ghwanukghutaneasa eara aseasa!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 16:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwashuubean beasta leabu heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghwalas uhuuda fuga nyiit bughalaji iyeenya ea haradam ea damanamughuush ghwarda hideedean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.16.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.16.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
